# Vitest writes snapshot files with LF. With core.autocrlf=true (the default on
# the Windows dev machine) git checks them out as CRLF, so the first test run
# rewrites every snapshot and the tree goes dirty with an EMPTY `git diff` —
# which also blocks `git checkout` with "local changes would be overwritten".
# Pinning snapshots to LF makes what git writes match what vitest writes.
*.snap text eol=lf
